KJV: Beth-ezel.

H1019.definition:
from H1004 (בַּיִת) and H1537 (גִּלְגָּל) with the article interposed; house of Gilgal (or rolling);
Beth-hag-Gilgal, a place in Palestine
KJV: Beth-gilgal.

H1020.definition:
from H1004 (בַּיִת) and the plural of H3451 (יְשִׁימַה) with the article interposed; house of the deserts;
Beth-ha-Jeshimoth, a town East of the Jordan
KJV: Beth-jeshimoth.

H1021.definition:
from H1004 (בַּיִת) and H3754 (כֶּרֶם) with the article interposed; house of the vineyard;
Beth-hak-Kerem, a place in Palestine
