H1022.definition:
patrial from H1035 (בֵּית לֶחֶם) with the article inserted;
a Beth-lechemite, or native of Bethlechem
KJV: Bethlehemite.

H1023.definition:
from H1004 (בַּיִת) and H4801 (מֶרְחָק) with the article interposed; house of the breadth;
Beth-ham-Merchak, a place in Palestine
KJV: place that was far off.

H1024.definition:
