KJV: Beth-shean, Beth-Shan.

H1053.definition:
from H1004 (בַּיִת) and H8121 (שֶׁמֶשׁ); house of (the) sun;
Beth-Shemesh, a place in Palestine
KJV: Beth-shemesh.

H1054.definition:
